        "rationale": "The question concerns activation by an SFC request, not whether responsibility has been retained or discharged. Continuing responsibility survives either trigger result, although compliance forms part of the minimum demonstration content.",
        "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE_TO_THIS_QUESTION"
