        "rationale": "Paragraph 14 expressly supports demonstration upon request to the SFC's satisfaction of the three specified matters. Footnote 5 adds minimum compliance and smart-contract assurance content. Its unconditioned wording leaves exclusivity of the request trigger unresolved, but does not negate the stated duty when a request is made.",
        "status": "SUPPORTED"
      }
